Generated by tools/make_extra_missions.py (non-commercial, CC BY-NC-SA with the Diaspora content).
$End Notes:

$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~11 min | Difficulty: Hard]] Raptor recon found a basestar drifting dark at the edge of the Kobol debris field. It could be dead, or it could be waiting. You take Lantern 1, a Raptor, in close enough to scan it, with Shadow and Flask flying escort. Get the scan and get out.", -1)
$end_multi_text

